note=e63e7d14efa1e2c3\" title=\"73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton\">73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"85832410fcdc9965\" href=\"?note=85832410fcdc9965\" title=\"73-df-word-homomorphism\">73-df-word-homomorphism</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"277b77eecf2ab276\" href=\"?note=277b77eecf2ab276\" title=\"73-df-language-quotients\">73-df-language-quotients</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c284ffb568a496fd\" href=\"?note=c284ffb568a496fd\" title=\"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class\">73-df-finite-automaton-language-class</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dcfl\\text{-}regular\\text{-}operations}\\vdash\nL\\cap R\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}\\land L/R\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}\\land h^{-1}[K]\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dcfl\\text{-}regular\\text{-}operations}\\vdash\nL\\cap R\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}\\land L/R\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}\\land h^{-1}[K]\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>交用 DPDA 与 DFA 的乘积。逆同态以有限缓冲模拟每个字符的像，并保持 ε／读入互斥的规范调度。右商不能直接猜测后缀，否则会失去确定性；原书使用 predicting machine 在栈上维护可继续接受的有限摘要。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton","status":"resolved","id":"e63e7d14efa1e2c3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-word-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"85832410fcdc9965","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading"